' the title logo: 8 rows of 28 columns (columns 2-29)
data TitleMap bytes
  $80,$80,$8A,$87,$88,$8B,$87,$88,$8A,$87,$85,$87,$8B,$85,$8A,$87,$88,$8A,$87,$88,$89,$80,$80,$8B,$87,$85,$80,$80
  $80,$80,$89,$80,$89,$91,$90,$85,$8D,$90,$80,$80,$89,$80,$91,$90,$89,$89,$80,$80,$89,$80,$80,$91,$90,$80,$80,$80
